---
layout: base
title: "Topics & Feeds"
description: "Browse all topics. Every tag has its own archive page and RSS feed. Subscribe to as many as you like."
permalink: /tags/
---

<div class="page-hd">
  <h1>Topics &amp; <em>feeds</em></h1>
  <p>Every topic has its own page and RSS feed. Subscribe to individual topics in your RSS reader, or import all of them at once with the <a href="/feeds/opml.xml">OPML bundle</a>.</p>
</div>

<table class="feeds-table">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Topic</th><th>Posts</th><th>Feed</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="nm"><a href="/">All posts</a></td>
      <td class="ct">{{ collections.posts | length }}</td>
      <td class="fd"><a href="/feed.xml">/feed.xml</a></td>
    </tr>
    {%- for tag in collections.tagList | byCount(collections.posts) %}
    {%- set count = collections.posts | byTag(tag) | length %}
    <tr>
      <td class="nm"><a href="/tag/{{ tag }}/">{{ tag }}</a></td>
      <td class="ct">{{ count }}</td>
      <td class="fd"><a href="/feeds/tags/{{ tag }}/feed.xml">/feeds/tags/{{ tag }}/feed.xml</a></td>
    </tr>
    {%- endfor %}
    <tr>
      <td class="nm"><a href="/feeds/opml.xml">All feeds</a></td>
      <td class="ct">bundle</td>
      <td class="fd"><a href="/feeds/opml.xml">/feeds/opml.xml</a></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

{% include "partials/topic-columns.njk" %}
